ກະລຸນາບອກວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້.

678
00:41:25,450 --> 00:41:31,450
[PRINCE CHARMING]
Is that the right word? "Smote?" "Smooote." Is that even a word actually? Maybe I should just smite him.
ເຈົ້າເຮັດຫຍັງ?

679
00:41:31,950 --> 00:41:33,950
[PRINCE CHARMING]
Let's try this again. Now...
ເຈົ້າຈະຮູ້ສຶກຊັກຊ້າ ແລະອາດມີອາການບໍ່ສະບາຍໃນທ້ອງຕໍ່າ
ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນເຮັດໄດ້

680
00:41:34,450 --> 00:41:36,450
[PRINCE CHARMING]
(playing the scene out
ແລະຂ້ອຍແມ່ນຂ້ອຍ!

681
00:41:36,950 --> 00:41:40,100
[QUIETLY)]
Shrek attacks me, I pretend to be afraid.  Ooh!!!
ພວກເຈົ້າຄົນທຸກຍາກ.

682
00:41:40,600 --> 00:41:46,600
[PRINCE CHARMING]
I say...  "Finally the Kingdom will get the happily ever after they deserve, die Ogre", blah, blah, blah...
ສະບາຍດີດີ້ ຂໍໂທດທີ່ມາຊ້າ ເຈົ້າເປັນແນວໃດ?

683
00:41:47,100 --> 00:41:49,900
[PRINCE CHARMING]
Oh! It just doesn't feel real enough yet!
ກຸຍກຸຍ!

684
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:52,500
[PRINCE CHARMING]
Who told you to stop dancing?!
ຂ້ອຍເຄີຍຢາກຫຼີ້ນດົນຕີຟລອຍ.

685
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:58,250
[CYCLOPS]
Uh... Wink and turn, wink and turn. Shrek the Third - Final Screening Script 87.
"ຮ້ອນ!"

686
00:41:58,750 --> 00:42:02,250
[PRINCE CHARMING]
And what are you laying around for? Get up! Honestly.
"ຈືດ!"

687
00:42:02,750 --> 00:42:08,750
[PRINCE CHARMING]
Our happily ever after is nearly complete, mummy. And I assure you, the people of this kingdom will pay dearly for every second we've had to wait.
"ໂຊກຮ້າຍ!"

688
00:42:09,250 --> 00:42:13,800
[SHREK]
Break a leg. Or, on second thought, let me break it for you.
"ຮາຮາ ຮາຮ່າ".

689
00:42:14,300 --> 00:42:20,250
[PRINCE CHARMING]
Thank goodness you're here. I was beginning to think you might not make it back in... time.
ຝູງຊົນພາກັນງຽບ.

690
00:42:20,750 --> 00:42:22,750
[SHREK]
Where's Fiona?
ດຽວນີ້ເຈົ້າຈະຮູ້ວ່າຂ້ອຍຮູ້ສຶກແນວໃດ

691
00:42:23,250 --> 00:42:26,750
[PRINCE CHARMING]
Don't worry. She and the others are safe. For now.
ງຽບໆ!

692
00:42:27,250 --> 00:42:29,250
[ARTIE]
Ow.
ແລະພວກມັນສວຍງາມ!

693
00:42:29,750 --> 00:42:31,750
[PRINCE CHARMING]
Let me guess... Arthur?
ຍຸກສະໄຫມໃຫມ່ ໃນທີ່ສຸດກໍເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ!

694
00:42:32,250 --> 00:42:34,250
[ARTIE]
It's Artie, actually.
ໂອ້, ງ່າຍໆ.

695
00:42:34,750 --> 00:42:39,300
[PRINCE CHARMING]
This boy is supposed to be the new King of Far Far Away?
"ກະກຽມສັດຮ້າຍ".

696
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:43,650
[PRINCE CHARMING]
How pathetic! Now, stand still so I won't make a mess.
...ເພາະວ່າຂ້ອຍຈະບໍ່ປະຖິ້ມຂອງຂ້ອຍ.

697
00:42:44,150 --> 00:42:49,050
[SHREK]
Charming, stop! I'm here now, you got what you wanted. This isn't about him.
"Ha ha ha ha haa. ນົກຂະຫນາດນ້ອຍເອົາປີກ,
ບິນລົງຈາກຕົ້ນໄມ້ທີ່ພວກເຂົາປາກົດຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ chirp ໃນຫູຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ".

698
00:42:49,550 --> 00:42:53,050
[ARTIE]
Then who's it about? I'm supposed to be King, right?
ບໍ່!

699
00:42:53,550 --> 00:42:57,750
[SHREK]
You weren't really next in line for the throne, okay? I was.
ເງື່ອນ ໄຂ ການ ສະ ແດງ ຄັ້ງ ທີ 3 ແລະ ສຸດ ທ້າຍ 107.

700
00:42:58,250 --> 00:43:01,400
[ARTIE]
But you said the King asked for me personally.
ໂອ້, ມັນເປັນຫຍັງອີກຄັ້ງ?

701
00:43:01,900 --> 00:43:03,900
[SHREK]
Not exactly.
ນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນຄວາມສຸກຕະຫຼອດຊີວິດຂອງຂ້ອຍ.

702
00:43:04,400 --> 00:43:06,400
[ARTIE]
What's that supposed to mean?
ເຈົ້າບອກຂ້ອຍວ່າ ເຈົ້າຢາກເປັນຄົນຮ້າຍຕະຫຼອດຊີວິດ?

703
00:43:06,900 --> 00:43:12,900
[SHREK]
Look, I said whatever I had to say, alright! I wasn't right for the job, I just needed some fool to replace me, and you fit the bill. So just go!
ສຸດທ້າຍແລ້ວ.

704
00:43:13,400 --> 00:43:15,850
[ARTIE]
You were playing me the whole time.
ອີກຕົ້ນໄມ້ອັນຕະລາຍຫນຶ່ງປົກປິດປາກຂອງເຈົ້າຊາຍ
Charming ແລະຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ motiones ກັບ Artie.

705
00:43:16,350 --> 00:43:22,300
[SHREK]
You catch on real fast kid... Maybe you're not as big of a loser as I thought.
ເຮີ, ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ກິ່ນ Shrek Jr.

706
00:43:22,800 --> 00:43:26,650
[ARTIE]
You know, for a minute there, I actually thought you -
ເດັກນ້ອຍເກັ່ງ, ເກັ່ງ.

707
00:43:27,150 --> 00:43:33,150
[PRINCE CHARMING]
What? That he cared about you? He's an ogre. What did you expect? Shrek the Third - Final Screening Script 90.
ເດັກນ້ອຍຢູ່ໃສ?

708
00:43:33,650 --> 00:43:36,800
[PRINCE CHARMING]
You really do have a way with children, Shrek.
ດີ, ຖ້າມັນມີຄ່າ, ເຈົ້າກໍຈະເຮັດເຊັ່ນກັນ.

709
00:43:37,300 --> 00:43:43,300
[SNOW WHITE]
Had we just stayed put like I suggested, we could be sipping tea out of little heart-shaped cups... Shrek the Third - Final Screening Script 91.
ໂອ້ ຂໍຢ່າປະພຶດແບບບໍ່ມີຄວາມຜິດ ເຈົ້າທັງສອງກໍຮູ້ເລື້ອງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຕະຫຼອດເວລາ
ແລະເຈົ້າກໍຮັກສາໄວ້ໄວ້ໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເອງ.

710
00:43:43,800 --> 00:43:45,800
[CINDERELLA]
Yeah... yeah, heart shaped cups.
ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ມັນ.

711
00:43:46,300 --> 00:43:48,300
[SNOW WHITE]
Eating crumpets smothered with loganberries.
ອາກ.

712
00:43:48,800 --> 00:43:50,800
[CINDERELLA]
Yeah... loganberries.
ແລະຂ້ອຍບໍ່ແມ່ນເຈົ້າ!

713
00:43:51,300 --> 00:43:53,300
[SNOW WHITE]
Shut up Cindy.
...ກະຕ່າຍ!

714
00:43:53,800 --> 00:43:55,800
[CINDERELLA]
Yeah, shut up.
ໂອ້, ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ.

715
00:43:56,300 --> 00:43:58,300
[CINDERELLA]
No! You shut up!
ຂອບໃຈ.

716
00:43:58,800 --> 00:44:00,800
[CINDERELLA]
Just stay out of this!
ຂໍອະໄພ, ນັ້ນແມ່ນບ່ອນນັ່ງຂອງຂ້ອຍ.

717
00:44:01,300 --> 00:44:03,750
[SNOW WHITE]
Who cares who's running the kingdom anyway?
ໂອ້ ຜູ້ຊາຍ.

718
00:44:04,250 --> 00:44:06,250
[FIONA]
I care.
ຂ້ອຍ?

719
00:44:06,750 --> 00:44:08,850
[QUEEN]
And you should all care too.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ຂອບໃຈເອດ.

720
00:44:09,350 --> 00:44:11,350
[PUSS]
Hey, hey, hey, hey.
...ຫຼືພຽງແຕ່ຜູ້ເສຍຫາຍ...

721
00:44:11,850 --> 00:44:14,300
[DONKEY]
Yeah, and I have your badge number,
ໂອ້... ດີແລ້ວ, ດີແລ້ວ... ເບິ່ງ..

722
00:44:14,800 --> 00:44:20,800
["TIN CAN-"]
Puss, in Donkey's body, hisses and arches his back like a cat. Shrek the Third - Final Screening Script 92.
ເຈົ້າ...?

723
00:44:21,300 --> 00:44:23,300
[FIONA]
Donkey?!
ໂອໂອໂອ!

